sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> (친구에게) '나한테 그 열쇠 줘!'</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Geb mir den Schlüssel!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Gibt mir den Schlüssel!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Gibst mir den Schlüssel!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Gib mir den Schlüssel!</button></div><div class=\"qe\">geben은 e → i 동사라서 du 명령형도 바뀐 모음을 그대로 써요. du gibst에서 -st를 빼면 Gib!예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> (친구에게) '잘 자!'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Schläf gut!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Schlaf gut!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Schlafe du gut!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Schläfst gut!</button></div><div class=\"qe\">a → ä 동사는 du 명령형에서 움라우트가 없어요 — Schlaf!</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;vergisst&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Du <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(vergessen)</span> den Termin.</div><div class=\"qko\">너는 그 약속을 잊어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Du <b>vergisst</b> den Termin.</div>vergessen은 e → i 동사예요. 어간이 -ss로 끝나서 du에 -t만 붙여요 — du vergisst.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;empfiehlt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Der Kellner <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(empfehlen)</span> den Fisch.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 웨이터는 그 생선 요리를 추천해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Kellner <b>empfiehlt</b> den Fisch.</div>empfehlen은 e → ie 동사예요 — er empfiehlt.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;öffnet&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Er <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(öffnen)</span> die Tür.</div><div class=\"qko\">그가 그 문을 열어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Er <b>öffnet</b> die Tür.</div>어간이 -ffn으로 끝나면 발음 때문에 -e-를 넣어요 — er öffnet.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wirst&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Du <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(werden)</span> bald Vater.</div><div class=\"qko\">너는 곧 아빠가 돼요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Du <b>wirst</b> bald Vater.</div>werden은 불규칙이라서 통째로 외워요 — ich werde · du wirst · er wird.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Gib ihn dem Kind&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">(친구에게) '그것(der Löffel)을 그 아이에게 줘!'</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">ihn</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">dem</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Gib</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Kind</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Gib ihn dem Kind!</b></div>du 명령형 Gib!이 맨 앞에 와요.<br>der Löffel은 4격 대명사 ihn이 되고, 대명사가 명사 dem Kind보다 앞이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die Tochter hilft der Oma&quot;,&quot;Der Oma hilft die Tochter&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 딸이 할머니를 도와요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Tochter</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">hilft</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Oma</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Die</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die Tochter hilft der Oma.</b></div>helfen은 e → i 동사라서 sie(딸)에서 hilft예요.<br>helfen은 3격 동사라서 der Oma예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Ihr fährt zu schnell.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Er hält das Baby.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ihr lest viel.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Du heißt Jonas.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">모음 변화는 du와 er·sie·es에서만 일어나요. ihr는 바뀌지 않아서 Ihr fahrt zu schnell.이 맞아요.<br>ihr lest(어간 -s + t), du heißt(-ß + t), er hält(어미 -et 없음)는 모두 맞아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> Sie(그녀) <span class=\"qblank\"></span> die Antwort. / Sie(그녀) <span class=\"qblank\"></span> den Lehrer.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) weiß … kennt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) weiß … kennen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) weißt … kennt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) kennt … weiß</button></div><div class=\"qe\">답(정보)은 wissen, 사람은 kennen이에요.<br>wissen은 er·sie에서 어미가 없어서 sie weiß, kennen은 규칙대로 sie kennt예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> '그 문장을 읽어(요)!'를 du · ihr · Sie 순서로 바르게 쓴 것은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Lies den Satz! · Liest den Satz! · Lesen Sie den Satz!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Lies den Satz! · Lest den Satz! · Lesen Sie den Satz!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Les den Satz! · Lest den Satz! · Lesen Sie den Satz!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Lies den Satz! · Lest den Satz! · Lies Sie den Satz!</button></div><div class=\"qe\">e → ie 동사의 du 명령형은 바뀐 모음 그대로 Lies!예요.<br>ihr 명령형은 ihr lest에서 ihr만 빼서 Lest!, Sie 명령형은 원형 + Sie예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wohnt&quot;],[&quot;ist&quot;],[&quot;arbeitet&quot;],[&quot;liest&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Mia <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(wohnen)</span> in Köln. Sie <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(sein)</span> Ärztin, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(arbeiten)</span> viel und <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(lesen)</span> abends Krimis.</div><div class=\"qko\">미아는 쾰른에 살아요. 그녀는 의사이고, 일을 많이 하고, 저녁에는 추리 소설을 읽어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Mia <b>wohnt</b> in Köln. Sie <b>ist</b> Ärztin, <b>arbeitet</b> viel und <b>liest</b> abends Krimis.</div>wohnt는 규칙 -t, ist는 sein의 불규칙형이에요.<br>arbeiten은 어간 -t라서 -e-를 넣고(arbeitet), lesen은 e → ie에 어간 -s라서 -t만 붙여요(liest).</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Öffne&quot;],[&quot;Nimm&quot;],[&quot;Sei&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> (친구에게) <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(öffnen)</span> das Fenster, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(nehmen)</span> den Mantel und <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(sein)</span> bitte leise!</div><div class=\"qko\">(친구에게) '창문 열고, 외투 챙기고, 조용히 좀 해!'</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · (친구에게) <b>Öffne</b> das Fenster, <b>Nimm</b> den Mantel und <b>Sei</b> bitte leise!</div>어간이 -ffn이면 발음 때문에 du 명령형에 -e를 붙여 Öffne!예요.<br>nehmen은 du nimmst에서 -st를 빼 Nimm!, sein의 du 명령형은 Sei!예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Geben Sie es ihr&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">(손님에게) '그것(das Formular)을 그녀에게 주세요!'</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">es</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Sie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">ihr</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Geben</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Geben Sie es ihr!</b></div>Sie 명령형은 동사 + Sie가 맨 앞이에요.<br>das Formular는 4격 es, '그녀에게'는 3격 ihr이고, 대명사 둘은 4격 → 3격 순서예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"30\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 30</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"